exports[`a pull request that changes the schema posts the comment: verdict, counts, then sections by severity 1`] = `
"### Breaking schema change

1 breaking · 2 dangerous · 5 safe

#### Breaking

- \`Query.orders(status:)\` changed type from \`OrderStatus\` to \`OrderStatus!\`

#### Dangerous

- \`OrderStatus.REFUNDED\` added to enum · clients that switch over \`OrderStatus\` may not handle it
- \`Query.search(sort:)\` optional argument added · existing calls now take its default

<details><summary>5 safe changes</summary>

- \`Invoice\` type added
- \`Order.invoice\` added
- \`Query.invoices\` added
- \`User.displayName\` added
- \`User.email\` deprecated: "Use \`User.contact.email\`"

</details>

This check fails on breaking changes. Adding the label \`schema-change-accepted\` accepts them for this pull request.

<sub>Cambium · [larssondaniel/cambium](https://github.com/larssondaniel/cambium)</sub>"
`;

